ita","Heino Bohn Nielsen","Anders Rahbek"],"y":2011,"c":"pub","j":"Econometrics Journal","v":"14","i":"2","p":"131-155","r":75,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1368-423x.2010.00333.x","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1111/j.1368-423x.2010.00333.x"},{"t":"Testing for co-integration in vector autoregressions with non-stationary volatility","a":["Giuseppe Cavaliere","Anders Rahbek","A.M. Robert Taylor"],"y":2010,"c":"pub","j":"Journal of Econometrics","v":"158","i":"1","p":"7-24","r":26,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jeconom.2010.03.003","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1016/j.jeconom.2010.03.003"},{"t":"Likelihood-based inference for cointegration with nonlinear error-correction","a":["Dennis Kristensen","Anders Rahbek"],"y":2010,"c":"pub","j":"Journal of Econometrics","v":"158","i":"1","p":"78-94","r":26,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jeconom.2010.03.010","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1016/j.jeconom.2010.03.010"},{"t":"COINTEGRATION RANK TESTING UNDER CONDITIONAL HETEROSKEDASTICITY","a":["Giuseppe Cavaliere","Anders Rahbek","A.M. Robert Taylor"],"y":2010,"c":"pub","j":"Econometric Theory","v":"26","i":"6","p":"1719-1760","r":54,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1017/s0266466609990776","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1017/s0266466609990776"},{"t":"THE LIKELIHOOD RATIO TEST FOR COINTEGRATION RANKS IN THE I(2) MODEL","a":["Heino Bohn Nielsen","Anders Rahbek"],"y":2007,"c":"pub","j":"Econometric Theory","v":"23","i":"04","r":54,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1017/s0266466607070272","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1017/s0266466607070272"},{"t":"ON THE LAW OF LARGE NUMBERS FOR (GEOMETRICALLY) ERGODIC MARKOV CHAINS","a":["Søren Tolver Jensen","Anders Rahbek"],"y":2007,"c":"pub","j":"Econometric Theory","v":"23","i":"04","r":54,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1017/s0266466607070326","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1017/s0266466607070326"},{"t":"ASYMPTOTICS OF THE QMLE FOR A CLASS OF ARCH(q) MODELS","a":["Dennis Kristensen","Anders Rahbek"],"y":2005,"c":"pub","j":"Econometric Theory","v":"21","i":"05","r":54,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1017/s0266466605050474","lt":"pub",